---
import OrderFlow from './anim/OrderFlow.astro';
import Monitor from './anim/Monitor.astro';
---
<section id="faq">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="sec-num">04</span>
    <h2>常見問題</h2>
    <span class="sec-note">/ 發案前先問清楚</span>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-q"><span class="faq-mark">Q</span>如果我不是技術背景，要怎麼跟你溝通需求？</h3>
      <p class="faq-a">
        你不需要懂任何程式碼。我提供完整的需求訪談，你會拿到一份白話文的流程圖（如：訂單成立 →
        自動通知 → 完成訂單 → 自動開立發票），確認符合你的商業邏輯後開始開發。
      </p>
      <figure class="faq-fig">
        <div class="faq-fig-bleed">
          <div class="anim-wrap">
            <OrderFlow />
            <!-- Phones only (hidden by CSS above 768px): the diagram sits
                 still until this is tapped, then runs the timeline once. -->
            <button type="button" class="anim-play" aria-label="播放訂單流程動畫">
              <span class="anim-play-badge" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
              <span class="anim-play-text">播放流程</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>訪談後你會拿到的流程圖：每個步驟做什麼、誰會收到通知，一眼看完。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </article>

    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-q"><span class="faq-mark">Q</span>結案後系統如果壞掉怎麼辦？</h3>
      <p class="faq-a">
        專案包含維護與監控，並會配置自動化報錯系統，確保營運不中斷。
      </p>
      <figure class="faq-fig">
        <div class="faq-fig-bleed">
          <div class="anim-wrap">
            <Monitor />
            <button type="button" class="anim-play" aria-label="播放監控報錯動畫">
              <span class="anim-play-badge" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
              <span class="anim-play-text">播放流程</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>服務出狀況時，監控會比你先發現，並自動通報到 LINE 與 Email。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
